{{Term/Store|Fierce Deity Boots|Fierce Deity Boots|Series, BotW, TotK}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Fierce Deity Boots are pieces of [[Armor]] in {{BotW}}. They are obtained by scanning the {{MM|-}}-themed {{TLoZ|-}} Series Link [[amiibo]] with the [[Amiibo (Ability)|amiibo]] [[Rune]]. According to their description, the Fierce Deity Boots are the same boots as the ones worn by the Fierce Deity in the [[Era of the Hero of Time]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

When worn, the Fierce Deity Boots provide one level of [[Attack Up]]. The Fierce Deity Boots can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]], though they cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Fierce Deity Boots, alongside the [[Fierce Deity Armor]] and [[Fierce Deity Mask]], compose the [[Fierce Deity Set]].

